From 63ba268812feabece166939f90bbe0ea297e6c31 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 09:41:57 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] bluray: hold HDMV menu pages until their picture is presented

The library draws an HDMV menu page when the player reads the data
that carries it, which runs ahead of the picture on screen by the
player's buffer depth. A page timed with its video shows early, and the
page of a closed playlist is cleared as early.
---
